## Example

```json
{
  "node_type": "digest",
  "properties": {
    "schedule_type": "static",
    "schedule": {
      "frequency": "daily",
      "time": "09:00",
      "tz_selection": "recipient"
    },
    "retain_count": 50,
    "retain_order": "last"
  }
}
```
